<h2 id="va-enumerations">Enumerations</h2>

<p>Every value that an enum-typed field in the decision notice may carry, with its meaning.</p>

<h3 id="enum-bescheidart">BescheidArt</h3>

<table class="complex data longlastcol enum-table">
  <colgroup>
    <col style="width:18%">
    <col style="width:82%">
  </colgroup>
  <thead><tr><th>Value<th>Meaning</tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>ERSTBESCHEID</code><td class="long">First (initial) decision notice for a given Erstattungsantrag.</tr>
    <tr><td><code>KORREKTUR</code><td class="long">Corrected decision notice superseding an earlier one for the same Erstattungsantrag -- not chained to which specific earlier notice it corrects (only back to the original application, via Bezugsantrag).</tr>
  </tbody>
